<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Groundwork</title>
    <style>
        .signup-btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; background: #D98E58; color: #FAF3E8; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { background: #FAF3E8; font-family: sans-serif; color: #3A2E28; margin: 0; }

        header { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 10; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 24px 40px; background: #FFFDF9; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #E4D8C4; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
        header.header-hidden { transform: translateY(-100%); }
        .logo { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #D98E58; }
        nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
        nav a.secondary { text-decoration: none; color: #3A2E28; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
        nav a.primary { text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; background: #D98E58; color: #FAF3E8; }

        .hero { position: relative; min-height: 620px; display: flex; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; padding: 100px 60px 60px 60px; }
        .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: url('/images/forest.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; }
        .hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(250,243,232,0.75) 0%, rgba(250,243,232,0.35) 45%, rgba(250,243,232,0.1) 70%); }
        .hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 40px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

        .hero-text { max-width: 480px; text-align: left; }
        .hero-text h1 { font-size: 56px; margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #3A2E28; line-height: 1.05; }
        .tagline { color: #3A2E28; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5; }

        .hero-chart-panel { background: rgba(255,253,249,0.72); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(58,46,40,0.08); }
        .chart-wrap { animation: spin 60s linear infinite; }
        @keyframes spin { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        .stat-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; text-align: left; }
        .stat-number { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #B5651D; line-height: 1; }
        .stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: #8A7A68; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-top: 3px; }
        .dot { display: inline-block; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
        .resolved-dot { background: #6B7B4F; }
        .open-dot { background: #D98E58; }

        .how-section { padding: 90px 40px; text-align: center; }
        .how-heading { font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .how-subheading { color: #8A7A68; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
        .steps-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 70px; flex-wrap: wrap; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .step-col { max-width: 260px; }
        .step-number { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D98E58; color: #FAF3E8; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px; margin: 0 auto 18px auto; }
        .step-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .step-desc { font-size: 15px; color: #8A7A68; line-height: 1.5; }

        .faq-section { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 100px auto; padding: 0 40px; }
        .faq-heading { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center; }
        .faq-subheading { text-align: center; color: #8A7A68; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        details { background: #FFFDF9; border: 1px solid #E4D8C4; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 20px 24px; }
        summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
        summary::after { content: "+"; font-size: 22px; color: #D98E58; font-weight: bold; }
        details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
        details p { margin: 14px 0 0 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B5B4F; line-height: 1.6; }

        footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #A89A8A; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header id="siteHeader">
        <div class="logo">Groundwork</div>
        <nav>
            <a class="secondary" href="/login">Staff Login</a>
            <a class="primary" href="/new">Submit a Ticket</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-bg"></div>
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="hero-inner">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <h1>IT Help Desk</h1>
                <p class="tagline">Report technical issues and track their resolution — internal IT support made simple.</p>
                <a class="signup-btn" href="/account/signup">Sign Up</a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-chart-panel">
                <div class="chart-wrap">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" width="200" height="200">
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="45" fill="none" stroke="#F0E4D3" stroke-width="16" />
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="45" fill="none" stroke="#6B7B4F" stroke-width="16"
                            stroke-dasharray="<%= resolvedArc %> <%= circumference %>"
                            stroke-dashoffset="0"
                            transform="rotate(-90 60 60)" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="45" fill="none" stroke="#D98E58" stroke-width="16"
                            stroke-dasharray="<%= openArc %> <%= circumference %>"
                            stroke-dashoffset="<%= -resolvedArc %>"
                            transform="rotate(-90 60 60)" stroke-linecap="round" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-list">
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-number"><%= totalCount %></div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Total tickets</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-number"><span class="dot resolved-dot"></span><%= resolvedCount %></div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Resolved</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat">
                        <div class="stat-number"><span class="dot open-dot"></span><%= openCount %></div>
                        <div class="stat-label">Open</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="how-section">
        <div class="how-heading">How It Works</div>
        <div class="how-subheading">New here? Here's what happens after you submit a ticket.</div>
        <div class="steps-row">
            <div class="step-col">
                <div class="step-number">1</div>
                <div class="step-title">Tell Us What's Wrong</div>
                <div class="step-desc">Click "Submit a Ticket" and describe your issue — no account needed. Include what device you're using and what you were doing when the problem started.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-col">
                <div class="step-number">2</div>
                <div class="step-title">We Start Working On It</div>
                <div class="step-desc">IT staff review your ticket and begin working on a fix. You'll be able to check back anytime to see its current status.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-col">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <div class="step-title">Your Issue Gets Resolved</div>
                <div class="step-desc">Once fixed, your ticket is marked Resolved and the time it took is recorded, so we can keep improving response times.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-section">
        <div class="faq-heading">Common Issues</div>
        <div class="faq-subheading">Quick fixes before you submit a ticket</div>

        <details>
            <summary>My computer won't connect to the network</summary>
            <p>Try restarting your router and computer first. If the issue persists after restarting both devices, submit a ticket under the Network category so staff can check for a broader outage.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>I forgot my account password</summary>
            <p>Password resets require identity verification and can't be completed through this form. Submit a ticket under Account Access with your employee ID so staff can process the reset securely.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>My printer isn't working</summary>
            <p>Check that the printer is powered on and has paper loaded, and try restarting it. If it still isn't responding, submit a ticket under Hardware with the printer's location included.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>An application keeps crashing</summary>
            <p>Try closing and reopening the application, and restart your computer if the issue continues. If it keeps happening, submit a ticket under Software with the application name and what you were doing when it crashed.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>I can't log into my email</summary>
            <p>Double-check your username and password for typos, and confirm Caps Lock isn't on. If you're still locked out, submit a ticket under Account Access — do not share your password in the ticket description.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>My VPN won't connect</summary>
            <p>Confirm you're connected to the internet first, then try restarting the VPN client. If it still fails to connect, submit a ticket under Network and mention any error message shown.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>My monitor or display isn't working correctly</summary>
            <p>Check that all cables are firmly connected and try a different port if one is available. If the screen stays blank or the issue continues, submit a ticket under Hardware.</p>
        </details>

        <details>
            <summary>I need new software installed</summary>
            <p>Software installations require approval before they can be completed. Submit a ticket under Software with the name of the application and a brief reason for the request.</p>
        </details>
    </div>

    <footer>Groundwork IT &middot; Internal Use Only</footer>

    <script>
        const header = document.getElementById('siteHeader');
        let lastScrollY = window.scrollY;

        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
            const currentScrollY = window.scrollY;

            if (currentScrollY > lastScrollY && currentScrollY > 80) {
                header.classList.add('header-hidden');
            } else {
                header.classList.remove('header-hidden');
            }

            lastScrollY = currentScrollY;
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
